milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-10-09T05:19:21Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T18:42:54Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.7.2, e7cfa294a0b81bed7986be04a848cc1832a3f083\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.2.stable - SteamOS holo on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Mobile) - integrated Turnip Adreno (TM) 750 - (8 threads) - 15.29 GiB memory - PulseAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nUsing `rendering/driver/threads/thread_model` `Separate` causes frame times to be much worse in XR projects on the Steam Frame. An empty scene is a candidate for Steam Frame \"Verified\" on thread model `Safe`, but drops to \"Unsupported\" for exceeding the 11ms / 72hz frame time on `Separate`.\n\nWith `Safe` <img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c85e5d39-6f2a-413e-a67b-10721f6844a4\" />\n\nWith `Separate` <img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3c586f32-625d-4071-9636-115397cc3607\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nRun the MRP on the Steam Frame and change the rendering thread model back and forth.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[xr-perf-test.tar.gz](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/33234956/xr-perf-test.tar.gz)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124314/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124314/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}